WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.377
Use this practice ladder to build skill gradually.

00:00:03.377 --> 00:00:09.452
Start with a no-parameter function, then add one parameter, then return a value.

00:00:09.452 --> 00:00:17.535
After that, practice handling a predictable error and combine defaults, documentation, and return values.

00:00:17.985 --> 00:00:24.332
At every level, explain the function in terms of input, process, and output.

00:00:24.332 --> 00:00:28.633
That explanation is more important than memorizing syntax.
